{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "Ribbon",
  "theme": "ribbon",
  "_about": "Ribbon cluster, generated by design/gen_ribbon.py (edit that and regenerate): calm and premium. One ribbon of light under the hood line fills with the revs (shaders.js ribbon; cool white to amber to red), a dot and a number at every thousand, a huge thin speed, the gear in a small frame (shaders.js deco, the backdrop), oil / coolant / boost on the left and the drive mode / fuel / average speed on the right (range, clock and outside temperature are BMW's own strip's, which shows under the theme). Holiday editions (the 'holiday' setting, Auto by the date): Christmas (the line becomes a string of bulbs, snow), Thanksgiving, New Year, Fourth of July, each with its colours, art and greeting. With 'Leave room for the driver camera' on, the line's middle drops under the camera. Clear of BMW's black box and belt light. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
